{"seq":1,"slug":"dx-foundations-and-value","title":"DX 基础与价值","docCount":3,"url":"/h/devops-tools/developer-experience-engineering/dx-foundations-and-value","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-is-dx-platform-engineering","title":"什么是开发者体验","url":"/h/devops-tools/developer-experience-engineering/dx-foundations-and-value/what-is-dx-platform-engineering","wordCount":2598,"readingTime":11},{"seq":2,"slug":"measuring-developer-productivity","title":"度量开发者生产力","url":"/h/devops-tools/developer-experience-engineering/dx-foundations-and-value/measuring-developer-productivity","wordCount":2777,"readingTime":12},{"seq":3,"slug":"platform-engineering-golden-path","title":"平台工程与黄金路径","url":"/h/devops-tools/developer-experience-engineering/dx-foundations-and-value/platform-engineering-golden-path","wordCount":3203,"readingTime":13}],"introMarkdown":"# DX 基础与价值 简介\n\n要改善开发者体验，先得理解它**是什么、为什么重要、怎么衡量**。本章打地基：先讲清**什么是 DX 与平台工程**（DX 的定义、内循环 vs 外循环、为什么 DX 直接影响交付速度与人才留存），然后是**开发者生产力的度量**（DORA 四指标、SPACE 框架、以及为什么「代码行数/提交数」是有害的错误度量），最后是**平台工程与黄金路径**（把分散的工具组织成内部平台、用「黄金路径」把最佳实践做成默认选项）。理解这些，你才能把 DX 改进从「凭感觉修修补补」变成「有方向、可衡量的工程」。\n"}